        "goal_understanding": "Navigate the grid, adjust the carried piece's shape, color, and rotation using modifier tiles, and step onto each goal only when all three attributes match its requirements. Completing every goal advances through the levels and winning all levels completes the game.",
        "mechanics_understanding": "Each move costs one stamina, and reaching zero costs a life before stamina resets. Walls block movement, so blocked_directions must be checked before every move. Shape modifiers cycle shapes 0\u20135, color modifiers cycle orange\u2192blue\u2192green\u2192red\u2192orange, and rotation modifiers turn the piece 90\u00b0 clockwise. A matching goal activates and is completed by stepping onto its cell; blocked moves still waste stamina."
